      {
        "id": 244879,
        "name": "",
        "username": "skywhale",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/skywhale/{size}/5248_2.png",
        "created_at": "2022-04-29T12:15:39.776Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group quote-modified\" data-username=\"X-metal\" data-post=\"23\" data-topic=\"29275\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/x-metal/48/4892_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> X-metal:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Demon Cat (is it one word or two) is wrong, they actually wrote about Demons at both the start of the month and the end of the month as all cats are demons, which I suppose makes their name ironic.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p><a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/guise-cat\">@Guise-Cat</a>, are you just gonna take this slander?</p>\n<p>And as a person that lives with cats myself, I am also deeply offended. My cats are fluffy and adorable, and only sometimes wake me up in the morning with wailing moans because I’m not in the same room as them (which is clearly my fault, and something I’m working on). At least they don’t go pooping on other people’s lawns or screaming at every stranger (or friend) that walks near my house.</p>",
